{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 15, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x: u2, y: u2) = x & y\n  ucas: gates it\ngates for it: 4 input bits -> 2 output bits, basis c\n  minimal: cost 2, 2 steps (no program of cost <= 1 exists; 6 candidates searched)\n  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 16 care inputs\n  t0 = and(x0, y0)               = x0 & y0\n  t1 = and(x1, y1)               = x1 & y1\n  r1 = t1\n  r0 = t0\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 15, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "gates for x & y for unsigned 2-bit x and unsigned 2-bit y", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x: u2, y: u2) = x & y", "gates it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "gates", "basis": "c", "input_bits": 4, "output_bits": 2, "constant_bits": 0, "minimal": true, "cost": 2, "steps": 2, "candidates": 6, "program": [{"dst": "t0", "gate": "and", "args": ["x0", "y0"], "expr": "x0 & y0"}, {"dst": "t1", "gate": "and", "args": ["x1", "y1"], "expr": "x1 & y1"}], "outputs": {"r1": "t1", "r0": "t0"}}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "truth_table", "points": 16, "passed": true, "text": "every output bit on every care input"}], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "iterative deepening on cost: no program of a lower cost exists"}, "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x: u2, y: u2) = x & y\n  ucas: gates it\ngates for it: 4 input bits -> 2 output bits, basis c\n  minimal: cost 2, 2 steps (no program of cost <= 1 exists; 6 candidates searched)\n  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 16 care inputs\n  t0 = and(x0, y0)               = x0 & y0\n  t1 = and(x1, y1)               = x1 & y1\n  r1 = t1\n  r0 = t0\n"}, "isError": false}}
