{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 17, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: y' = -y\n  ucas: y(0) = 1\n  ucas: dsolve y\ny' = -y, y(0) = 1\n  (on [0, 10]; 'dsolve y to T' for another end)\n  linear with constant coefficients: eigenvalues -1\n  y(t) = exp(-t)\n  check: satisfies the equations at 201 points of [0, 10] (max relative residual 0) and the initial values\n  numeric (Dormand-Prince 5(4), adaptive, 213 steps) agrees with it to 7.8e-12\n      t            y(t)\n      0            1\n      1            0.3678794412\n      2            0.1353352832\n      3            0.04978706837\n      4            0.01831563889\n      5            0.006737946999\n      6            0.002478752177\n      7            0.0009118819656\n      8            0.0003354626279\n      9            0.0001234098041\n      10           4.539992976e-05\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 17, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "solve the ODE y' = -y with y(0) = 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["y' = -y", "y(0) = 1", "dsolve y"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "dsolve", "var": "t", "from": 0, "to": 10, "symbolic": true, "method": "eigenvalues -1", "solution": {"y": "exp(-t)"}, "function": "y", "table": [[0, 1], [1, 0.36787944117144233], [2, 0.1353352832366127], [3, 0.049787068367863944], [4, 0.01831563888873418], [5, 0.006737946999085467], [6, 0.0024787521766663585], [7, 0.0009118819655545162], [8, 0.00033546262790251185], [9, 0.00012340980408667956], [10, 4.5399929762484854e-05]]}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "residual", "points": 201, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "satisfies the equations and the initial values"}, {"kind": "numeric_solution", "points": 11, "max_diff": 7.75013386800083e-12, "passed": true, "text": "Dormand-Prince 5(4) against the symbolic solution"}], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: y' = -y\n  ucas: y(0) = 1\n  ucas: dsolve y\ny' = -y, y(0) = 1\n  (on [0, 10]; 'dsolve y to T' for another end)\n  linear with constant coefficients: eigenvalues -1\n  y(t) = exp(-t)\n  check: satisfies the equations at 201 points of [0, 10] (max relative residual 0) and the initial values\n  numeric (Dormand-Prince 5(4), adaptive, 213 steps) agrees with it to 7.8e-12\n      t            y(t)\n      0            1\n      1            0.3678794412\n      2            0.1353352832\n      3            0.04978706837\n      4            0.01831563889\n      5            0.006737946999\n      6            0.002478752177\n      7            0.0009118819656\n      8            0.0003354626279\n      9            0.0001234098041\n      10           4.539992976e-05\n"}, "isError": false}}
